Fixing: 'Fixing' is also eligible for any citizen of the Top Area who wants to stop growing and getting older.

Top Area: A place where citizens with high privileges live. It is completely normal to see people walking with their slaves in the streets. People need to be registered to access this area.

Middle Area: Literally below the Top Area. This area doesn't have access to the sun light, being highly illuminated only by artificial lights. This part of the city is mainly vertical, with high buildings, bridges above bridges connecting a building to another, flying vehicles and a Cyberpunk Tokyo style. People born in this place mostly had never seen sunlight.
